{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:38:53+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Assassin's Creed® Odyssey", "steam_appid": 812140, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "dlc": [937890, 937891, 937892], "detailed_description": "<h1>Ultimate Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/0cc16226dc3c2a6dd7b78c0664c2aed5.avif?t=1793886405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras_big/0cc16226dc3c2a6dd7b78c0664c2aed5.avif?t=1793886405 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The base game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Season Pass: 2 expansions, 1 mission, Assassin's Creed III and Liberation Remastered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Deluxe Pack: 2 gear packs, 1 naval pack, and temporary boosts</p></p><br><h1>Gold Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/132bad3c4456726a963cfaa9310e76b9.avif?t=1793886405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras_big/132bad3c4456726a963cfaa9310e76b9.avif?t=1793886405 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold Edition includes the base game and the Season Pass:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Legacy of the First Blade expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Fate of Atlantis expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Secrets of Greece bonus mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Assassin's Creed III Remastered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Assassin's Creed Liberation Remastered</p></p><br><h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/1217b69b6e422a25651dbd5022de1bb0.avif?t=1793886405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras_big/1217b69b6e422a25651dbd5022de1bb0.avif?t=1793886405 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deluxe Edition includes the base game and the Deluxe Pack:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kronos Pack: 5 epic pieces of armor, 1 epic weapon, 1 epic mount</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Herald of Dusk Pack: 5 rare pieces of armor, 1 rare weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capricornus Naval Pack: 1 ship design, 1 crew theme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Temporary XP Boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Temporary Drachmas Boost</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AS A SPARTAN WARRIOR</h2>Forge your own odyssey in a world on the brink of chaos and become a legendary Spartan hero, fighting mythical creatures along the way. Charge into epic clashes between Sparta and Athens, with battles pitting 150v150 soldiers against each other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/eaa6f1cc43fec99430fae0d3eb602271.poster.avif?t=1793886405\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/eaa6f1cc43fec99430fae0d3eb602271.webm?t=1793886405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/eaa6f1cc43fec99430fae0d3eb602271.mp4?t=1793886405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL TO ANCIENT GREECE</h2>Make your way through wild landscapes, vibrant cities, and iconic historical sites. Sail across shimmering seas, climb towering mountains, and discover the heart of a civilization.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/f022a99a01686b412a956953309a0441.poster.avif?t=1793886405\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/f022a99a01686b412a956953309a0441.webm?t=1793886405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/f022a99a01686b412a956953309a0441.mp4?t=1793886405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR PATH</h2>Your choices shape the world around you. Play in a living world that constantly reacts to your every decision: forge alliances, spark conflicts, and determine the fate of characters. Customize your gear, ship, and special abilities to become a legend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/646cf9e9db25b449a6b05445dc04af0a.poster.avif?t=1793886405\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/646cf9e9db25b449a6b05445dc04af0a.webm?t=1793886405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/646cf9e9db25b449a6b05445dc04af0a.mp4?t=1793886405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AS A SPARTAN WARRIOR</h2>Forge your own odyssey in a world on the brink of chaos and become a legendary Spartan hero, fighting mythical creatures along the way. Charge into epic clashes between Sparta and Athens, with battles pitting 150v150 soldiers against each other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/812140/extras/eaa6f1cc43fec99430fae0d3eb